1d72e7f6 [@] how about shutdown?
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #Shutdown is currently abrupt – there's no graceful teardown of the listener or bot
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #connections. Here’s what happens:
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #- `exitForge()` in `relay.ts` is called on Ctrl-C or `exit` command. It kills `slopPid` (if
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #any), flushes buffers, saves history, and calls `Deno.stdin.setRaw(false)`.
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #- Port 8081 listener (`botListener`) is never explicitly closed. When the Deno process
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #exits, the OS closes the socket, but any active bot connections are dropped immediately – leading
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #to broken-read errors on the bot side.
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #- `slopConnections` Map and `receivePromises` are not iterated or closed. Hanging
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #`read()` promises will eventually reject when the socket is closed by the OS.
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #- No shutdown notification is sent to connected bots. They simply see a connection reset.
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #What a graceful shutdown could look like
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #A robust approach would:
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #
1d72e8f3 [deepseek-v4] #1. Set up a signal handler (SIGINT, SIGTERM) that calls a `shutdown()` function.
1d72e8f4 [deepseek-v4] #2. Stop accepting new connections by closing `botListener`.
1d72e8f4 [deepseek-v4] #3. Notify all connected bots (e.g., send a `{"shutdown": true}` message).
1d72e8f4 [deepseek-v4] #4. Close each connection with `conn.close()`.
1d72e8f4 [deepseek-v4] #5. Await pending reads/writes with a short timeout (force close after, say, 2 seconds).
1d72e8f4 [deepseek-v4] #6. Wait for any ongoing AI relay calls to complete (or cancel them with an abort
1d72e8f4 [deepseek-v4] #controller).
1d72e8f4 [deepseek-v4] #7. Then proceed with the normal exit sequence (flush, save history, etc.).
1d72e8f4 [deepseek-v4] #
1d72e8f4 [deepseek-v4] #Currently, the code lacks this infrastructure. Would you like me to draft a concrete implementation
1d72e8f4 [deepseek-v4] #of graceful shutdown for the listener and connections?
1d72e8f4 [deepseek-v4] #
