1db0f104 [deepseek-v4] #without CPU intervention.
1db0f104 [deepseek-v4] #- Teletext implementation with Hamming encoding – faithful to the standard, rather than
1db0f104 [deepseek-v4] #just a pattern.
1db0f104 [deepseek-v4] #
1db0f104 [deepseek-v4] #The project demonstrates sophisticated use of the RP2350’s PIO capabilities and is a solid
1db0f104 [deepseek-v4] #foundation for a retro video generator. With corrections to the chroma clock divider and a careful
1db0f104 [deepseek-v4] #review of data formats between PIO programs, it should produce a stable PAL signal.
