1db17433 [deepseek-v4] #114.5 µs.
1db17433 [deepseek-v4] #A PAL line is 64 µs. The active region (back porch + burst + video) is about 57.7 µs (≈
1db17433 [deepseek-v4] #1020 samples at 17.735 MHz). So the current setting overflows into the next line’s sync, corrupting
1db17433 [deepseek-v4] #the signal.
