1db17433 [deepseek-v4] #2. Burst length too short (32 instead of 40 samples)
1db17433 [deepseek-v4] #`colorWord[2]` and `colorWord[3]` each contain 16 samples, giving 32 samples = 8 subcarrier cycles.
