1e05d692 [gemini-3.1-pro] #• SM2 config needs `smconfigsetjmppin(&config, PUMP2_ENABLE);`
1e05d692 [gemini-3.1-pro] #• SM3 config needs `smconfigsetjmppin(&config, PUMP3_ENABLE);`
1e05d692 [gemini-3.1-pro] #
1e05d693 [gemini-3.1-pro] #Does this align with how you were visualizing the 16-color mapping?
