1e429e26 [deepseek-v4] #
1e429e26 [deepseek-v4] #5. System clock – 166.5 MHz exactly matches the PAL pixel clock requirement (64 µs line /
1e429e26 [deepseek-v4] #10656 cycles = 166.5 MHz). That's precise.
