1e429e26 [deepseek-v4] #6. BootSel – The `ReadBootSel()` function checks the QSPI CS pin to detect if the user is
1e429e26 [deepseek-v4] #holding the boot button, triggering a USB boot reset. That's a typical feature for RP2350 firmware
1e429e26 [deepseek-v4] #updates.
