1e9412e5 [deepseek-v4] #
1e9412e5 [deepseek-v4] #As a quick test, try toggling the LED for a different stall condition (e.g., `RXSTALL`) to see if
1e9412e5 [deepseek-v4] #it's actually a TX stall or something else. Or monitor the DMA completion and the `FDEBUG` flags
1e9412e5 [deepseek-v4] #more thoroughly.
1e9412e5 [deepseek-v4] #
1e9412e6 [deepseek-v4] #If you can share the `initFrame()` and `progressiveWordCount` definitions, I can help you fix the
