1eee43c1 [deepseek-v4] #To get a ~440 Hz square wave without using the FIFO, we need to build a larger counter using nested
1eee43c1 [deepseek-v4] #loops, because each `SET` can only load up to 31. I'll use three levels of nesting:
1eee43c1 [deepseek-v4] #
1eee43c2 [deepseek-v4] #- Outer loop controlled by Z (`set z, 5` → 6 iterations)
1eee43c2 [deepseek-v4] #- Middle loop controlled by Y (`set y, 31` → 32 iterations)
